 ║ COULEE TEACHERS OFFER THEIR TRADES. After your walk with Crier Toke, each   ║
 ║ trade's teacher offers you its first quest.                                 ║
 ║ QUEST GEAR. What a quest hands you fades if it leaves your hands. Lose it   ║
 ║ and the giver hands you another.                                            ║
 ║ COMMANDS WAIT THEIR TURN. Commands sent quickly wait in line, up to ten at  ║
 ║ a time.                                                                     ║
 ║ ONE FLEE A ROUND. A second try in the same round waits for the next.        ║
 ║ The novel: https://dogmud.org/novel                                         ║
 ║ Full patch notes: https://dogmud.org/patch-notes                            ║
